/-!
# Imported inputs for the final online step

Generated by `gen_s1.py`. This additive interface is shared with step zero.
Coordination note: State1 includes the sampled payload lift before its root
quantifier, so step-one preprocessing uses the same retained private payload.
Only imported root relations and the refreshed hint occur below: no computed
state LUT, smudge relation, final noise inequality or output correctness is an
input. Every root and hint error uses the certified envelope n+2.
-/

